url: "https://m.canouil.dev/NACHO/"
abstract: >-
  NACHO (NAnoString quality Control dasHbOard) analyses exported NanoString
  nCounter data and helps users run quality control, by showing quality control
  metrics, control gene expression, principal components and sample-specific
  size factors in an interactive web application.
keywords:
  - R
  - NanoString
  - nCounter
  - quality control
  - normalisation
  - Shiny
